id: care
name: Care
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Medicine
requiresSkill: medicine
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 2 Hours
# "Target a Character." The one token targeted - themselves too.
targetsCharacter: true
# "They regain Life Points equal to 1/4 of their maximum."
lifeShare: 4
# "That Character may also be treated as if they used the Rest Maneuver (this does not count towards the
# Rest Maneuver's Session Limit)." Offered when it is done; the Rest's own use is not touched.
alsoAs: rest
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Two hours tending someone: a quarter of their Life Points back - and, if they like, a Rest's worth
  too, without spending their Rest.
text: >
  Care: You provide extensive medical intervention for someone who has been injured.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Medicine
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 2 Hours
  –Effect: Target a Character. They regain Life Points equal to 1/4 of their maximum. That Character
  may also be treated as if they used the Rest Maneuver (this does not count towards the Rest
  Maneuver’s Session Limit).

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Medicine. Used at the one token targeted;
# the card names them. Once the two hours are spent, its button gives them a quarter of their most
# Life Points, and asks whether they are also treated as having Rested - half their Life and Ki Points,
# the Rest Maneuver's own - which leaves their Rest unspent.
